      "content": "An attacker could like private posts shared to a victim’s Twitter Circle using the /FavoriteTweet GraphQL endpoint, despite not being a member of the Twitter Circle. The attacker could then request their account archive to view the contents of the private post, despite not having permission to view the post within the application.",
